              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "nascarrunner71"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve tried a lot of different recipes and this one is the closest to perfection. When I use the Libby ratio, my husband always says “more nutmeg, less clove”. (However, I like ginger so I increase the ginger to 1/2. Personal preference). We use it in our oatmeal or simple syrup for coffee. Also, great for baking by subbing in anywhere there is cinnamon.",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-19T16:07:31.757Z"
          },
          {
